# Supabase service role keys (NEVER commit these!)
supabase-service-role-key.txt
service-role-key.txt

# Documentation and guides (not tracked in git)
Documents/
Guide/
User-Management-Notes/

# Note about config.js:
# - config.js contains Supabase anon key (safe to expose - designed for client-side)
# - config.js contains Microsoft OAuth client ID (safe to expose - public identifier)
# - However, if you add Stripe publishable keys or other sensitive data, keep config.js in .gitignore
# - For GitHub Pages: You can manually add config.js after deployment, or use GitHub Secrets
# - Use config.js.example as a template (this file IS tracked in git)

